---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout
  title={"Nicole Szatkowski — Founder of Kidashi Design"}
  description={"Canonical profile for Nicole Szatkowski: IHK-certified Media Designer, digital nomad, and founder of Kidashi Design in Tbilisi, Georgia."}
  ogImage={"https://www.kidashidesign.com/images/Nicole-Portrait.webp"}
  navVariant={"nav--light"}
>
  <section class="about-content" style="padding-top: calc(var(--nav-h) + clamp(3rem, 6vw, 6rem)); padding-bottom: 6rem;">
    <div class="container" style="max-width: 800px; margin: 0 auto;">
      
      <!-- HEADER -->
      <header class="reveal" style="margin-bottom: 4rem; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border-color, #eee); padding-bottom: 2rem;">
        <h1 style="margin-bottom: 0.5rem;">Nicole Szatkowski</h1>
        <p style="font-size: 1.25rem; font-weight: 500; color: var(--terra, #d35400);">
          <strong>IHK-certified Media Designer</strong><br>
          Founder of <strong>Kidashi Design</strong>
        </p>
      </header>

      <!-- SECTIONS -->
      <div class="about-content__main">
        
        <h2 class="reveal">Professional Background</h2>
        <p class="reveal" data-delay="100">
          With over 5 years of experience in visual communication and design, Nicole's background combines deep technical training with real-world agency experience. Before founding her own studio, she built her foundation with three years in content management, followed by roles as a graphic designer across multiple agencies.
        </p>

        <h2 class="reveal" style="margin-top:3rem;">Certification</h2>
        <p class="reveal" data-delay="100">
          Nicole holds a formal certification as an <strong>IHK-certified Media Designer (Digital &amp; Print)</strong>, completed at the <a href="https://www.mediadesign.de/en" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Mediadesign University of Applied Sciences (MD.H)</a> in Munich, Germany.
        </p>

        <h2 class="reveal" style="margin-top:3rem;">Areas of Expertise</h2>
        <ul class="reveal" data-delay="100" style="margin-bottom: 1.5rem; padding-left: 1.5rem;">
          <li>Web Design &amp; Development</li>
          <li>Brand Identity &amp; Strategy</li>
          <li>Print Design &amp; Typography</li>
          <li>Social Media Design &amp; Management</li>
        </ul>

        <h2 class="reveal" style="margin-top:3rem;">Experience</h2>
        <ul class="reveal" data-delay="100" style="margin-bottom: 1.5rem; padding-left: 1.5rem;">
          <li><strong>2025 – Present:</strong> Founder &amp; Lead Designer, Kidashi Design</li>
          <li><strong>Previous:</strong> Graphic Designer (Agency environments)</li>
          <li><strong>Previous:</strong> Content Management (3 years)</li>
        </ul>

        <h2 class="reveal" style="margin-top:3rem;">Selected Projects</h2>
        <p class="reveal" data-delay="100">
          <em>(Add 2-3 brief bullet points or sentences here about key client work, e.g., "Led full brand identity and digital presence for [Client Name]")</em>
        </p>

        <h2 class="reveal" style="margin-top:3rem;">Kidashi Design</h2>
        <p class="reveal" data-delay="100">
          In 2025, Nicole founded <strong>Kidashi Design</strong> to work directly with clients without the friction of traditional agency handoffs. As the sole founder and lead designer, she manages every project personally from the first sketch to the final launch.
        </p>

        <h2 class="reveal" style="margin-top:3rem;">Current Location</h2>
        <p class="reveal" data-delay="100">
          Originally from <strong>Bavaria, Germany</strong>, Nicole operates as a digital nomad and is currently based in <strong>Tbilisi, Georgia</strong>. Through remote collaboration, she builds high-performance web and brand identities for businesses worldwide.
        </p>
        
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>